<div class="modal-content">
    <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <h4 class="modal-title">Buyer Screen Help</h4>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">

        <h3>Buyer User Help Info:</h3>
        <p style="text-decoration: underline"> How to modify the column view:</p>
        <p>From the dashboard, you should be in the Purchasing WIP view;</p>

        <img src="~/assets/help/buyer-1.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />

        <p>Find the procedure name column;</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/buyer-2.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />

        <p style="text-decoration: underline"> Select;</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/buyer-3.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />

        <p>The following drop down menu will appear;</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/buyer-4.jpg" style="max-width: 800px;" />
        <br /><br /><br />

        <p>
            Modify the columns view as needed. Please note, you will not be able to modify the “Procedure Name” column;
        </p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/buyer-5.jpg" style="max-width: 800px;" />
        <br /><br /><br />

        <p>
            After you modify your columns, you can scroll side to side or up and down depending on how many work orders were generated.
        </p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/buyer-6.jpg" style="max-width: 800px;" />
        <br /><br /><br />

        <p>To reset your view, please navigate back to your dashboard; </p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/buyer-7.jpg" style="max-width: 800px;" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p>If you need additional assistance or have questions, please email support answer-support@msr-fsr.com</p>


    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary pull-left" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#supportModal"><i class="fa fa-life-bouy"></i> Open Ticket</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" onclick="js:window.print()"><i class="fa fa-print"></i> Print Help</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-warning" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-close-o"></i> Close</button>
    </div>
</div>

